      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EST",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "Also Vashti the queen made a feast for the women in the royal house which belonged to King Ahasuerus.",
      "ko": "왕후 와스디도 아하수에로 왕궁에서 부녀들을 위하여 잔치를 베푸니라",
      "source_text_hash": "ab185d29745cce68070da518e5e402b3b3a96c97cb3f9216bdba3b814e86e8dc",
      "translation_text_hash": "38c3c9d8c5fc4b731c00909adf9f2836f69d21701058f699851a63969f600899",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
