    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:EST:1:12",
      "sequence": 12715,
      "chapter_label": "EST 1",
      "verse_label": "12",
      "locator": {
        "book": "EST",
        "chapter": 1,
        "verse": 12
      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "EST",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "But the queen Vashti refused to come at the king’s commandment by the eunuchs. Therefore the king was very angry, and his anger burned in him.",
      "ko": "그러나 왕후 와스디가 내시의 전하는 왕명을 좇아 오기를 싫어하니 왕이 진노하여 중심이 불 붙는듯하더라",
      "source_text_hash": "9410744c0cbfbea36c105fa88678eaf871a572823828e07a5f12850ff99ac6aa",
      "translation_text_hash": "527f668c59e4b57f537d51a63edbced7c824ef63630f40c38684681da8b74703",
