          "book": "EST",
          "chapter": 1,
          "verse": 22
        }
      ],
      "en": "for he sent letters into all the king’s provinces, into every province according to its writing, and to every people in their language, that every man should rule his own house, speaking in the language of his own people.",
      "ko": "각 도 각 백성의 문자와 방언대로 모든 도에 조서를 내려 이르기를 남편으로 그 집을 주관하게 하고 자기 민족의 방언대로 말하게 하라 하였더라",
      "source_text_hash": "68fde80a25559895104a68bc677e4e2334c2a876cc8ac3969052693a71468643",
      "translation_text_hash": "ebcf273b5429fe24357113b8c59c3b36d794d2f6bf8ae899d0ca218e8ecfc1ac",
